<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Your bill is still unpaid</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f4f8fb; color: #263746; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
    .wrapper { width: 100%; padding: 32px 0; }
    .card { width: 92%; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(25, 65, 90, .08); }
    .header { padding: 28px 36px; background: #087f8c; color: #fff; }
    .brand { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; }
    .content { padding: 36px; line-height: 1.6; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 16px; color: #123c4a; font-size: 26px; }
    p { margin: 0 0 18px; }
    .amount { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 6px; background: #fdf1f2; color: #8a1f2b; font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; }
    .button { display: inline-block; margin: 8px 0 20px; padding: 13px 24px; border-radius: 6px; background: #087f8c; color: #fff !important; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
    .footer { padding: 22px 36px; background: #f7fafb; color: #71808a; font-size: 13px; }
    @media screen and (max-width: 480px) { .content, .header, .footer { padding: 26px 22px; } h1 { font-size: 22px; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="card">
      <header class="header">
        <p class="brand">MessMate</p>
      </header>
      <main class="content">
        <h1>Hi <%= userName || 'there' %>, one bill is still open</h1>
        <p>Your share for <strong><%= monthName %> <%= year %></strong> at <strong><%= messName %></strong> has not been settled yet.</p>
        <p class="amount">BDT <%= dueAmount %></p>
        <p>You can pay it with bKash from your bills page. Once the payment clears, the bill closes on its own.</p>
        <% if (loginUrl) { %>
          <a class="button" href="<%= loginUrl %>">Pay my bill</a>
        <% } %>
        <p>If you have already handed this amount to your manager, check with them that the mess ledger shows it.</p>
        <p>Warm regards,<br><strong>The MessMate Team</strong></p>
      </main>
      <footer class="footer">
        <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
        <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> MessMate. All rights reserved.</p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
